    "title": "1 killed in rollover crash in East Tulsa - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jacqueline Winchester ,\n10 hours ago TULSA, OKLA. (KTUL) — A man was killed in a single-vehicle rollover crash on Wednesday morning in East Tulsa. The Tulsa Police Department says they responded to 22100 E. 31st St. to investigate the crash and found a gray Honda Civic upside down in a pasture. The driver, identified as Craig Eberhart, 36, was pronounced dead. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
